{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48974","headline":"游嵩山 · 熊皎","name":"游嵩山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独背焦桐访洞天，暂攀灵迹弃尘缘。\n深逢野草皆疑药，静见樵人恐是仙。\n翠木入云空自老，古碑横水莫知年。\n可怜幽景堪长往，一任人间岁月迁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"熊皎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}